{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"bcce72e4f7882132","x":-125,"y":-30,"width":925,"height":790,"type":"text","text":"In the year 100PD there was a Eleven woman who once was the Queen of a nation called Koráki Kastro where Dasos Nerou now stands. Her name was Ravina Lumiere she was a sorceress who watched over her lands and despised the growing continent known as Unhileg this was all way before the rise of the whispered one. \n\nDuring that time she was constantly sending spies to Unhileg in an attempt to stop their rise in power, but they all were killed upon arrival and turned into undead slaves for the leader of the Unhileg. Because of this Ravina began to hate necromancers and those who toyed with the balance between life and death. In her later years she created a relic using a fragment of Iuons body which is now known as The Dreamers heart this relic has the power to change fate itself and with it Ravina began researching a way to use it to ascend to God hood. She did not want to ascend for glory but a sense of duty for something needed to protect the world of the brew of undeath that she saw coming in the years beyond her death.\n\nDuring her research she married and had a child whos name was Maelle. As a result of Ravina creating The Dreamers heart all of the future children born from the Lumiere bloodline have the power to bend fate to their will and this power courses within there bodies and souls. Before Maelle's adolescence Ravina wiped here own existence from every tome she could and every mind that knew who she was and Maelle was entrusted to the one woman whos memories remained the right hand of the queen her name was Xandria Volstar.\n\nEventually Ravina discovered the power she needed to ascend to God hood and with a multi year ritual she did just that. Leaving her nation alone and being the only God on the other side of the Divine Gate. \n\nWhen Maelle grew up she became aware of the power within her and discovered The Dreamers Heart in the ruins of the once great city of Koráki Kastro at the bottom of an ancient tomb. After she discovered her power she went behind her guardian Xandria's back and learned about her true mother Ravina. As a result of her research other forces caught wind of what Maelle was capable of and so she attracted the attention of Asmodeus. During her travels she met a man named Vax'Ildan and they fell in love, as she learned more about her mother and her past Vax began seeing the Raven Queen in visions at night and after 80 years he became the Champion of The Raven Queen his sworn duty is to protect those with the Lumiere bloodline starting with Maelle. 20 years later Maelle and Vax decided to have children and when they did Asmodeus saw it as his time to strike and attempted to steal the new born Lumiere child Vax'Ildan was able to protect the baby but in the process Maelle died in his arms and their child had been cursed by Asmodeus, marked so that one day he could comeback stronger than ever for the power that the Lumiere holds. Shortly after Vax'Ildan willingly sacrificed his soul to Ravina becoming immortal and living to forever protect those who carry the name.  All history beyond that is not tracked in time for this story."},
		{"id":"ef2d788f37214d2c","x":-137,"y":-242,"width":357,"height":102,"type":"text","text":"[[Ascension of the Raven Queen.canvas]]\n#Lore "}
